flowchart TD
    A[1 User message /chat<br/>support agent or ops manager] --> B{2 Pending side effect<br/>in current session?}
    B -- yes --> C{3 Reply type}
    C -- confirm --> D[Resume LangGraph checkpoint<br/>enter finalize_escalation]
    C -- cancel or timeout --> E[Clear pending state<br/>record canceled/timeout]
    C -- unrelated text --> F[Ask user to confirm or cancel first<br/>prevent HITL bypass]
    B -- no --> G[4 Input Guard<br/>business domain + injection risk]
    G -- rejected --> H[Safe rejection<br/>no tool execution]
    G -- accepted --> I[5 LLM Planner<br/>decompose task_plan]
    I --> J[6 select_next_task<br/>read-only first, side effects later]
    J --> K[7 extract_slots<br/>slot extraction + argument repair]
    K --> L[8 retrieve_context<br/>facts / policy / support corpus / category evidence]
    L --> M{9 Side-effect task?}
    M -- no --> N[10 execute_read_task]
    N --> J
    M -- yes --> O[11 build_after_sales_case]
    O --> P[12 Decision Engine]
    P --> Q[13 Verifier]
    Q --> R{14 Next action}
    R -- stop --> S[Safe rejection]
    R -- clarify --> T[Ask for missing information]
    R -- execute --> U[Low-risk automatic execution]
    R -- hitl --> V[LangGraph interrupt<br/>wait for confirmation]
    U --> W[15 ToolCallManager]
    D --> W
    W --> Y[16 execute_side_effect<br/>Redis lock + SQLite idempotency]
    S --> Z[17 finalize_answer]
    T --> Z
    E --> Z
    F --> Z
    H --> Z
    Y --> J
    J -- no remaining task --> Z
    Z --> AA[18 SQLite trace + case metrics]
    AA --> AB[Return answer / sources / session_id]
